[ti:A True Story]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.70]Lesson 119 | 第119课
[00:03.54]A true story | 一个真实的故事
[00:06.39]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.05]Who called out to the thieves in the dark? | 在黑暗中谁朝小偷喊了话?
[00:18.34]Do you like stories? | 你喜欢听故事吗?
[00:21.62]I want to tell you a true story. | 我想给你讲一个真实的故事。
[00:25.50]It happened to a friend of mine a year ago. | 它发生在我一个朋友身上,是一年前的事。
[00:30.72]While my friend, George, was reading in bed, | 我的朋友乔治在床上看书的时候,
[00:36.28]two thieves climbed into his kitchen. | 两个小偷爬进了他的厨房。
[00:41.06]After they had entered the house, | 他们进入房子之后,
[00:44.24]they went into the dining room. | 走进了餐厅。
[00:47.68]It was very dark, so they turned on a torch. | 里面很黑,所以他们打开了手电筒。
[00:54.53]Suddenly, they heard a voice behind them. | 突然,他们听到身后有个声音。
[01:00.20]'What's up? What's up?' someone called. | 有人喊道:'怎么回事?怎么回事?'
[01:05.80]The thieves dropped the torch and ran away as quickly as they could. | 小偷扔掉手电筒,飞快地逃跑了。
[01:14.22]George heard the noise and came downstairs quickly. | 乔治听到了响声,飞快地跑下楼来。
[01:20.22]He turned on the light, but he couldn't see anyone. | 他打开灯,但他看不见任何人。
[01:26.29]The thieves had already gone. | 小偷已经走了。
[01:30.04]But George's parrot, Henry, was still there. | 但乔治的鹦鹉亨利还在那里。
[01:35.75]What's up, George? he called. | 它叫道:'怎么了,乔治?'
[01:39.52]'Nothing, Henry,' George said and smiled. | 乔治笑着说:'没什么,亨利。'
[01:44.40]'Go back to sleep.' | '回去睡吧。'